{"4300520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Second Monitor Gladiators", "steam_appid": 4300520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second Monitor Gladiators</strong> is a lightweight ludus management game built specifically to be played or watched alongside your main activity. Train your gladiators, send them into battles, earn gold, and steadily grow your ludus into a legendary arena powerhouse—all without demanding your full attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on meaningful strategic decisions rather than heavy micromanagement. Assign gladiators to fights, manage upgrades, and observe battles unfold while you work, browse, stream, or play another game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against AI-controlled opponents or enter multiplayer, where your gladiators face off against fighters trained by other players. Victories earn gold, reputation, and the resources needed to strengthen your roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for short sessions or long-term progression, <strong>Second Monitor Gladiators</strong> fits perfectly on a second monitor, letting you manage your ludus at your own pace while staying focused on what matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300520/extras/c079ac332bada8c87a7329501ec73e79.poster.avif?t=1785326012\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300520/extras/c079ac332bada8c87a7329501ec73e79.webm?t=1785326012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300520/extras/c079ac332bada8c87a7329501ec73e79.mp4?t=1785326012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im